# Secrets and machine-specific paths (CLAUDE.md rule 5)
local.properties
*.keystore
*.jks
# Exception: the shared DEBUG keystore. Its password is the public Android default ("android"),
# it can only sign debug builds, and committing it gives every CI build the same signature so
# phone installs update in place. Never add a release keystore here.
!app/signing/kairo-debug.keystore
